%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cdeb4a8c9d90428bbab48a2aca1febe3, type: 3}
  m_Name: RillLines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - id: beat01_boot
    trigger: 0
    key: ToxicCity
    text: Systems nominal. I think.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat02_cargo
    trigger: 1
    key: C1_W004_RILL_ASKED_CARGO
    text: What are you carrying that requires containment?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat03_misidentify
    trigger: 1
    key: C2_W009_RILL_MISIDENTIFIED
    text: "I know this\u2014wait, I do not. That is new."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat04_shard
    trigger: 1
    key: C3_W013_MEMORY_SHARD
    text: I was here. Or something that used to be me was here.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat05_refusal
    trigger: 1
    key: C3_W019_RILL_REFUSED
    text: I cannot help you break this seal. Ask me why.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat06_color
    trigger: 1
    key: C4_W024_COLOR_NAMED
    text: That is the color I have been trying to name for 40,000 years.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat07_unprompted
    trigger: 1
    key: C4_W028_NO_JOB
    text: Some worlds do not want to be completed. This is one of them.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat08_staredown
    trigger: 1
    key: C5_W037_WARDEN_STANDOFF
    text: It recognizes me. Interesting.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat09_pattern
    trigger: 1
    key: C6_W039_PATTERN_WARNING
    text: It is not spreading toward you. It is spreading toward your memories.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat10_name
    trigger: 1
    key: C6_W051_RILL_NAMED
    text: I have carried a designation for 40,000 years. Today I would rather have
      a name.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat11_revelation
    trigger: 1
    key: C8_W062_REVELATION
    text: The Architects did not build this to keep stories in. They built it to
      keep something out.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat12_endA
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_A
    text: The network needs a witness. I was built for this. Go home, Cal.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat12_endB
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_B
    text: "Wherever you are crossing to \u2014 I am coming with you."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat12_endC
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_C
    text: Let me forget. Some memories are heavier than the cage that held them.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: beat12_endD
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_D
    text: I understand the Pattern now. It was never the enemy. It was the first
      of us.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w000
    trigger: 0
    key: W000_DriftIn
    text: ...there you are. I have been awake for six minutes and I already have
      opinions. The coupler is down; your papers are by the bunk. Shall we?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w002
    trigger: 0
    key: W002_DryCistern
    text: Cistern registry says these pumps died forty years ago. Contract says otherwise.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w003
    trigger: 0
    key: W003_GlassShelf
    text: Wind advisory. The baffles are down. That is the whole briefing.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w004
    trigger: 0
    key: W004_BroadcastTomb
    text: The broadcast spine is dark. Something here was transmitting long before
      the Guild arrived.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w005
    trigger: 0
    key: W005_OxidizedCanopy
    text: The canopy is growing through the machines. Do you think it minds us fixing
      them?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w006
    trigger: 0
    key: W006_MirrorFlats
    text: No lifesigns. No wind. Why does an empty world need this much light?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w007
    trigger: 0
    key: W007_SableStation
    text: This station is not on my charts. The person running it prefers it that
      way.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w008
    trigger: 0
    key: W008_SealedArchive
    text: An archive that was sealed from the inside. I have questions. I suspect
      it has answers.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w009
    trigger: 0
    key: W009_Chitinwall
    text: The wall is not architecture. It grew. Stay near the pylons.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w010
    trigger: 0
    key: W010_TidalArray
    text: The tide here does not follow the moon. It follows something else. I am
      still counting what.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w011
    trigger: 0
    key: W011_TheHum
    text: Listen. That sound is in the rock, not the machines. It was here first.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: enter_w012
    trigger: 0
    key: W012_MarasLastJump
    text: Mara filed a flight plan straight out of the system. I want to watch. I
      need to watch.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_fragment_t1
    trigger: 1
    key: FRAGMENT_T1_FOUND
    text: That recording is addressed to the watchers. It is mostly static. Keep
      it anyway.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_containment
    trigger: 1
    key: C2_CONTAINMENT_REVEALED
    text: "Her ship did not fail. The sky refused it. Cal \u2014 it's a cage."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_signal1
    trigger: 1
    key: SIGNAL_THRESHOLD_1
    text: Did you feel that? Every gate on the network just... inhaled.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_signal2
    trigger: 1
    key: SIGNAL_THRESHOLD_2
    text: "The Signal again. Stronger. It is not random \u2014 it answers you."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_first_release
    trigger: 1
    key: FIRST_RELEASE
    text: "Dropped gear stays where it falls \u2014 and stays behind when we travel.
      The holster on your hip keeps it with us."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_ship_board
    trigger: 1
    key: SHIP_FIRST_BOARD
    text: Home. Or the nearest thing either of us has to one.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: react_quarters
    trigger: 1
    key: QUARTERS_FIRST_VISIT
    text: Your quarters. The Guild manifest calls this compartment 'storage.' I disagree.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_any_brace
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: Brace. The tide has us.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_any_hold
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: Gate is open. Hold on to what you are holding.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_any_first
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: Every crossing still feels like the first one. For both of us.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_any_delight
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: Forty thousand years, and this part still delights me.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_any_count
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: "Crossing. Do not count the pillars \u2014 you will lose track on purpose."
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_w002
    trigger: 2
    key: W002_DryCistern
    text: 'Next stop: a hole in the ground with paperwork.'
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_w005
    trigger: 2
    key: W005_OxidizedCanopy
    text: Green on the other side. Try not to repair anything that is alive.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: gate_w012
    trigger: 2
    key: W012_MarasLastJump
    text: Mara crossed from here last. Watch the sky when we land.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w000
    trigger: 0
    key: W000_DriftIn
    text: Six minutes and you already have opinions. That tracks.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w002
    trigger: 0
    key: W002_DryCistern
    text: So the pumps died forty years ago and nobody updated the file. Sounds about
      right for this job.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w004
    trigger: 0
    key: W004_BroadcastTomb
    text: "Long before the Guild got here \u2014 or long before you did?"
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w005
    trigger: 0
    key: W005_OxidizedCanopy
    text: If it minds, it can file a complaint. We've got a contract.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w007
    trigger: 0
    key: W007_SableStation
    text: Good. I prefer people who prefer things.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w008
    trigger: 0
    key: W008_SealedArchive
    text: You keep saying that like it's new information about yourself.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w009
    trigger: 0
    key: W009_Chitinwall
    text: Everything out here either grew wrong or grew on purpose. I'm losing track
      of which is worse.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w011
    trigger: 0
    key: W011_TheHum
    text: First before what, RILL?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_w012
    trigger: 0
    key: W012_MarasLastJump
    text: Yeah. Me too.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_shard
    trigger: 1
    key: C3_W013_MEMORY_SHARD
    text: That's not weird at all. RILL, that is not weird even a little.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_refusal
    trigger: 1
    key: C3_W019_RILL_REFUSED
    text: "Okay. I trust you. I'd like to still trust you in an hour, so \u2014 anything
      you want to tell me first?"
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_color
    trigger: 1
    key: C4_W024_COLOR_NAMED
    text: Forty thousand years and you land on a color. I'd have picked a word. You're
      braver than I gave you credit for.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_standoff
    trigger: 1
    key: C5_W037_WARDEN_STANDOFF
    text: RILL. Do you know why?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_pattern
    trigger: 1
    key: C6_W039_PATTERN_WARNING
    text: My memories, or yours?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_named
    trigger: 1
    key: C6_W051_RILL_NAMED
    text: Then tell me. I've been waiting a while to stop calling you 'the drone.'
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_confess
    trigger: 1
    key: W053_COMPLETE
    text: "RILL \u2014 you don't have to finish that. Not tonight."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_revelation
    trigger: 1
    key: C8_W062_REVELATION
    text: Out. Not in. Say that again, slower.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_react_branch
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_BRANCH
    text: "Whatever I choose in there \u2014 I need you to know I heard everything
      you didn't say too."
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_end_a
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_A
    text: ...Okay. Okay. I'll come back. I don't care what the manifest says about
      return trips.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_end_b
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_B
    text: Then let's go find out together.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_end_c
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_C
    text: I'll remember for both of us, then. Deal?
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_end_d
    trigger: 1
    key: C12_W063_ENDING_D
    text: The first of us. Yeah. I believe that. I think I always kind of did.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_gate_any_pillars
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: Please tell me the pillars have names.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_gate_any_howdoyou
    trigger: 2
    key: '*'
    text: I still don't know how you make a tide out of light. I've stopped asking.
    once: 0
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: cal_gate_w007
    trigger: 2
    key: W007_SableStation
    text: Sable's turf. Manners, please.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 6
  - id: followup_cargo
    trigger: 3
    key: C1_W004_RILL_ASKED_CARGO
    text: I never received an answer about the cargo. I have stopped expecting one.
      That is new, too.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 9
  - id: followup_cage
    trigger: 3
    key: C2_CONTAINMENT_REVEALED
    text: 'I have had time to think about the cage. I keep arriving at the same word:
      deliberate. I did not expect to end up there.'
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 7
  - id: cal_followup_cage
    trigger: 3
    key: C2_CONTAINMENT_REVEALED
    text: You've had 'a while' to think about a lot of things. I'm starting to worry
      you're outpacing me on all of them.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: CAL
    crossingsDelay: 8
  - id: followup_refused
    trigger: 3
    key: C3_W019_RILL_REFUSED
    text: You never asked me again why I refused. I have been waiting. I think I
      am relieved you didn't.
    once: 1
    voClip: {fileID: 0}
    speaker: RILL
    crossingsDelay: 6
